title: The line being edited says who last changed it and when (and Not committed yet once it is typed on), each card says when its file was last changed, and the status bar says it for the selected file
folders: git-history
expect-log: last changes of 'git-history': \d+ files
expect-log: script: blame of src/steps\.rs line 1: You, just now . first
expect-log: script: blame of src/steps\.rs line 10: You, just now . notes and a step
expect-log: blame of src/steps\.rs: \d+ lines from 2 commits
expect-log: script: blame of src/steps\.rs line 2: You . Not committed yet

wait 3000
goto src/steps.rs
wait 1500
mark cards-and-status
wait 600
blame src/steps.rs 1
blame src/steps.rs 10
edit src/steps.rs 2 6
wait 800
mark caret-line-committed
wait 600
type X
wait 1500
blame src/steps.rs 2
mark caret-line-typed
wait 600
key save
wait 1500
mark saved-titles
wait 600
quit
